WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:02.690
<b>Amazon Lily
The Isle of Women
Calm Belt</b>

3
00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.280
<b>The Matter Involving Captain Koby</b>

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.610
We've kept men off this island for centuries,
excluding a slip-up or two.

5
00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:17.590
To think that those barbarians
would invade us now.

6
00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.800
They cut out a whole chunk

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.850
of the mountain
and the town was heavily damaged.

8
00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.050
As long as I'm here,
the Navy will keep coming back.

9
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.890
Where should I go
at times like this...

10
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.850
I just wanna marry Luffy.

11
00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.650
Don't you always want that?

12
00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:44.320
<b>A Few Weeks Ago</b>

13
00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.800
The gate's been destroyed!

14
00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:07.280
Don't let up yet!

15
00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.480
Not till we send them
to the bottom of the sea!

16
00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:14.240
Deploy the pacifistas!

17
00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.180
Immediately.

18
00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:16.390
Seraphim, go!

19
00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.530
Activate the camera.

20
00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.150
We need to record this battle!

21
00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:19.970
Roger that!

22
00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:22.760
Still not coming out
to fight, Hancock.

23
00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.560
<b>Vice Admiral Yamakaji</b>
<b>Marine Headquarters</b>

24
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.840
A warship is approaching!

25
00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.310
From six o'clock!

26
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:31.280
It's a pirate ship!

27
00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:32.330
This is mad!

28
00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:33.500
What happened?

29
00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:41.690
Blackbeard's attacking!

30
00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:42.890
Everyone, hold on!

31
00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:43.950
It's a Seaquake!

32
00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.850
It's gonna anger the Sea Kings!

33
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.050
Is that a child?

34
00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.260
We can't fight a little girl!

35
00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:57.700
How's she so strong?

36
00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:58.720
And look at her.

37
00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:00.620
I don't understand.

38
00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.470
Oh, Pirate Empress!

39
00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:15.910
Come out to play!

40
00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:22.700
We
came for a visit!

41
00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.870
And to take your Devil
Fruit power!

42
00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:25.940
Moodoon!

43
00:02:26.990 --> 00:02:28.300
Oh, Hancock.

44
00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.530
What a gorgeous
face you have.

45
00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:33.870
I would love to take your head
and keep it as a treasure.

46
00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:37.770
As long as I get her power, you
can do whatever the hell you want!

47
00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:41.220
Well, if that's the case, don't
chop her head off right away.

48
00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.170
Let's take her alive and we
can have some fun with her.

49
00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:45.050
Moodoon!

50
00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:47.190
Moodoon!

51
00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:50.150
Blackbeard!

52
00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:51.730
That's as far as you go!

53
00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.310
Vice Admiral, sir!

54
00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:56.140
We've made contact
with Blackbeard!

55
00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:57.480
Give the order to attack!

56
00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:58.990
Wait for HQ's approval.

57
00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:01.130
Carwag.

58
00:03:01.210 --> 00:03:02.900
Stay outta my way!

59
00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:24.170
Hancock!

60
00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.830
Get yer ass out here!

61
00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:34.630
Blackbeard is here?

62
00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:35.430
I see.

63
00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:38.970
I suppose there are plenty of reasons why
pirates like him would wanna target

64
00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.140
the former Warlords.

65
00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:48.690
We'll never gain any
ground like this!

66
00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:50.050
Watch out!

67
00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.250
Thanks for that!

68
00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:55.510
Anytime.

69
00:03:55.890 --> 00:04:00.480
Now let's hurry up and take care
of this before there are any more casualties.

70
00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.050
Hancock!

71
00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:05.930
The Navy does not desire
a fight with you or your people!

72
00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:10.240
If we can take you into custody,
then we will withdraw immediately!

73
00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.450
Don't push your luck,
Koby the Hero!

74
00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.140
We'll handle him, Sister.

75
00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:18.290
Stay inside.

76
00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:19.880
Don't be absurd.

77
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.590
They can't capture me.

78
00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:23.780
No one can.

79
00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.240
I will never bow
to the likes of them.

80
00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:30.960
Don't do this!

81
00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.570
Let us protect you!

82
00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:34.970
Commodore Teach!

83
00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.370
Nothing's working on this guy!

84
00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.170
Are...

85
00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.970
you kidding me?

86
00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:46.880
You all got your asses kicked
by that one little shrimp?

87
00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:56.270
Wait.

88
00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.360
That kid.

89
00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:02.850
He's got white hair,
brown skin, and black wings!

90
00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:22.810
P-x?

91
00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:30.050
He's a pacifista!

92
00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:31.700
No!

93
00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:35.110
No!

94
00:05:44.030 --> 00:05:45.010
Hey,

95
00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.000
Man!

96
00:05:59.530 --> 00:06:00.660
Pacifista brat!

97
00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:06.720
Huh? Where the hell is he?

98
00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.500
No!

99
00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:12.620
He's small, but his aura...

100
00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.300
It's huge!

101
00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.560
Right then, Black Hole!

102
00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.650
Whoa, man.

103
00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.880
This isn't looking good.

104
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.760
Hello there, lovely!

105
00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.630
Even the Blackbeard
Pirates are affected.

106
00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.010
Slave Arrow!

107
00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:09.480
This is a mess.

108
00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:11.800
We've got to go stop
her quick, Helmeppo.

109
00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:14.980
Helmeppo, no!

110
00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.450
The vice admiral, too?

111
00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:21.030
Pacifistas!

112
00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.160
Stand down!

113
00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.450
They'll break all of the people
who were petrified!

114
00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.490
Pacifistas!

115
00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:36.720
This is an order!

116
00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.090
Stop attacking!

117
00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.590
So that's Koby.

118
00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:44.770
Perfume...

119
00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:50.720
I can't dodge. She's too fast!

120
00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.540
Black Vortex!

121
00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:58.650
Like that?

122
00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:03.800
Stopped you dead
in your tracks.

123
00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:06.590
This is Darkness.

124
00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.690
It absorbs all Devil
Fruit powers.

125
00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:16.180
<b>Emperor Marshall D. "Blackbeard" Teach
Bounty: 3.996 Billion Former Warlord "Pirate Empress" Boa Hancock
Bounty: 1.659 Billion</b>

126
00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:18.020
Snake Princess!

127
00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:18.810
What happened?

128
00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.770
She can't use
her power anymore?

129
00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.800
You're disgusting.

130
00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.880
Unhand me at once.

131
00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.810
I shoulda known the Pirate Empress
wouldn't give up without a fight!

132
00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:31.310
You certainly did a number
on my crewmates.

133
00:08:31.390 --> 00:08:34.630
Turned those idiots to stone
the second they showed up!

134
00:08:36.770 --> 00:08:38.060
I knew she was tough,

135
00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.940
But this is beyond
anything I imagined.

136
00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:42.190
What should I do?

137
00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:44.120
That power of yours,

138
00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.130
I think it's gonna
serve me quite nicely.

139
00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:46.830
Hmph.

140
00:08:47.430 --> 00:08:50.880
Do as you will, but my power
is useless without my beauty.

141
00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:55.130
And if you kill me,
your crewmates will remain petrified.

142
00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:58.390
The next wielder cannot
undo the damage I've done.

143
00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:03.480
We're not getting
anywhere, are we?

144
00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:05.010
Help me out, Koby!

145
00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:08.810
You did me a real
favor last time we met!

146
00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:11.420
You were my hero
at Rocky Port, too!

147
00:09:12.140 --> 00:09:14.230
I've been on a roll
thanks to you!

148
00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:16.450
I was able to take
down Wang Zhi,

149
00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:19.880
and now Pirate Island is
my personal playground!

150
00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.630
Well? What d'you think?

151
00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:35.550
Make the call if I take my hands
off her like she requested,

152
00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.530
Do you think she'll
keep her word?

153
00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:41.670
Will she have any incentive to turn
my crewmates back if she's free?

154
00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:46.980
She needs to turn back
everyone here who was petrified.

155
00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.390
Marines included.

156
00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.140
I don't wanna fight you.

157
00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:52.400
If you leave,
I'll set them all free.

158
00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.040
Do we have a deal?

159
00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:57.490
Hell no!

160
00:09:58.040 --> 00:09:59.590
You're a liar.

161
00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:06.670
As soon as I let you go, you'll
turn everyone here into a statue.

162
00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:09.490
We'll be dead, just like that.

163
00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.100
Am I wrong?

164
00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:15.880
Let me go!

165
00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:18.650
As you've said,
you're quite the beauty.

166
00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:24.300
No one who sets eyes on you can resist
your power, no matter how strong we are.

167
00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:27.390
So, what to do...

168
00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.540
Safer to just kill you!

169
00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.110
Don't do this, Blackbeard!

170
00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:39.070
Think of how many lives
will be lost if she dies!

171
00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:55.800
I knew the Navy
would attack eventually.

172
00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:02.270
But I never imagined they'd
cut a hole out of the island.

173
00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:05.060
We'll have to find a way
to get out of here.

174
00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:05.940
Rayleigh?

175
00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.360
What the hell?

176
00:11:08.320 --> 00:11:10.480
Sorry to make you
wait, Hancock.

177
00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.740
I'm here now.

178
00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:13.280
Rayleigh.

179
00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:19.840
As for you, don't test
my patience any further.

180
00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:25.750
I never did like you,
Whitebeard's cabin boy.

181
00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.340
Let's make this quick!

182
00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:34.970
What?!

183
00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.150
Is that... Silvers Rayleigh?

184
00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:43.450
Listen,

185
00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.230
Hancock.

186
00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:53.880
Turn everyone back to normal.

187
00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.430
I'll keep your enemies
in check.

188
00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:59.450
None of you try
anything foolish.

189
00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:02.000
Leave this island in peace!

190
00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.000
<b>Present Day</b>

191
00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:16.290
I'm glad you're still alive.

192
00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.180
Dangerous times
we're living in, huh?

193
00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.830
We owe you our lives,
Rayleigh.

194
00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:23.690
Thank you.

195
00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:31.560
<b>"Dark King" Silvers Rayleigh
Right Hand of the Pirate King</b>

196
00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.310
New technology makes
for new threats.

197
00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.400
<b>Shakuyaku
Former Captain of the Kuja Pirates
Empress of Amazon Lily Two Generations Ago</b>

198
00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.130
What happens now?

199
00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:43.420
With those paddle ships,
the Calm Belt's not safe.

200
00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:48.690
I hope Vegapunk is happy
with the inconvenience he's caused us.

201
00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:52.090
The Navy launches a siege.

202
00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.470
Those strange new
weapons attack.

203
00:12:54.550 --> 00:12:56.910
Then Blackbeard comes
for our empress.

204
00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:01.250
I don't know what we would have
done without your aid.

205
00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.080
Yeah... I can't
take much credit.

206
00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:13.280
I couldn't have helped under
different circumstances.

207
00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.010
I hate to say it,
but I'm not a young man.

208
00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.800
I can't hope
to defeat Blackbeard.

209
00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.550
Not in his current state.

210
00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.510
This could've
been much worse.

211
00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:30.020
Those weapons.

212
00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.530
The strange children.

213
00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:33.890
It seems they're
quite powerful.

214
00:13:33.970 --> 00:13:37.530
To think the Navy would replace
the Seven Warlords with machines.

215
00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.430
They must be
confident in them.

216
00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.440
As well they should be,
I must admit.

217
00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.390
We couldn't even put a scratch
on those wretched little beasts.

218
00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:47.450
But that wasn't
the strangest part.

219
00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:52.800
I swear, one of them looked just like
Hancock did when she was a child.

220
00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.080
Yes, sir.

221
00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:01.990
We'll proceed to Egghead
and dock the ship.

222
00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:07.590
As for Captain Koby,
I'm afraid the news is true.

