305
00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:26.940
It's a lie!

306
00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.040
I know it is!

307
00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:30.000
Sabo would never kill.

308
00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.720
Vivi's dad!

309
00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:36.480
This's gotta be some kinda
setup, I'm telling you!

310
00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.740
Yes, I agree.

311
00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.790
It doesn't hold up
under scrutiny.

312
00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.780
The Revolutionary Army is
opposed to the World Nobles.

313
00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:45.930
Kings like Cobra
aren't their enemy.

314
00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:50.060
The Revolutionary Army declared
war on the Celestial Dragons. Hm.

315
00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:54.430
The Chief of Staff Sabo assassinated
King Cobra of Alabasta!

316
00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:55.540
There it is!

317
00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:00.590
Wait. His daughter Vivi,
the princess of Alabasta, disappeared?

318
00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:02.810
Ah! Vivi!

319
00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:05.650
If only I could be there
to comfort you right now!

320
00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:07.640
I hope you're okay!

321
00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:09.600
I say we should go
to Alabasta!

322
00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.080
Turn the ship around!

323
00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.550
The king's already dead.

324
00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:14.080
It's too late for us to help.

325
00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.870
And what would we
even do there?

326
00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.060
We don't have any
leads on Vivi, either.

327
00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.040
They lost track
of her in Mary Geoise.

328
00:15:20.100 --> 00:15:21.200
Then go there!

329
00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.070
Head to Mary Geoise!

330
00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:23.850
What?

331
00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:24.630
No.

332
00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.830
Surely I must have
misheard him, right?

333
00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:29.010
Even they're not that crazy!

334
00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:31.190
I can't hear a damn
thing in here!

335
00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.100
That's the enemy stronghold.

336
00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:36.590
We can't just march in there.

337
00:15:36.590 --> 00:15:38.750
You wanna pick
a fight in Navy HQ?

338
00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:39.580
Why not, huh?

339
00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:41.080
What's wrong?

340
00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.690
You scared, Zoro?

341
00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.870
We don't have a damned
thing to go off of!

342
00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.620
Calm the hell down,
would you?

343
00:15:48.310 --> 00:15:50.110
Vivi's dad is dead?

344
00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:51.530
That's horrible!

345
00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.150
Even though we're
a bunch of pirates,

346
00:15:54.230 --> 00:15:57.480
He was so nice to all of us!

347
00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.870
I am grateful from
the bottom of my heart.

348
00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:02.640
As a father and a native
of this land.

349
00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:06.220
Alabasta will forever be
in your debt, Straw Hats.

350
00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:09.020
Thank you all very much.

351
00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:15.360
He was the best king
in the whole world!

352
00:16:15.440 --> 00:16:16.550
Why did he have to die?

353
00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:20.880
Vivi! I'm so worried!

354
00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:23.520
She must be going
through so much!

355
00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.850
I hope she's okay.

356
00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:25.920
– Oh, Vivi!
– Vivi!

357
00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:29.340
– Vivi!
– Vivi!

358
00:16:29.560 --> 00:16:31.700
Seems the Reverie
was quite tumultuous.

359
00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.870
It's a shame she got
wrapped up in it.

360
00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:37.520
I simply can't imagine why the Revolutionary
Army would want to target

361
00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.830
Alabasta's king.

362
00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:39.980
Hold up a second.

363
00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:42.000
We met this Sabo
guy, didn't we?

364
00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.120
When was that?

365
00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:49.060
Oh, he came to Dressrosa!

366
00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:51.020
That was when you
last saw your bro!

367
00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.010
Right, Luffy?

368
00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:52.630
No!

369
00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.290
Vivi!

370
00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:54.550
Where did you go?

371
00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.670
I need to comfort you!

372
00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:57.490
Me, too!

373
00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:58.250
Come on!

374
00:16:58.250 --> 00:16:59.730
We'll rescue her!

375
00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:00.610
Let's go!

376
00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:03.400
Yeah!

377
00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:05.140
All of you need
to knock it off!

378
00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:07.030
Stop screaming and focus!

379
00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:08.830
C'mon, Luffy!

380
00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.730
You remember what you said?

381
00:17:10.810 --> 00:17:13.150
Two years ago, when
Ace was in trouble?

382
00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.030
Uh...

383
00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.810
Ace's adventures are his own business,
good or bad!

384
00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:23.950
You trusted your brother.

385
00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:27.470
You let him fight his own
battles, till it got ugly.

386
00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:32.310
You don't think
Vivi's weak, do you?

387
00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:35.450
'Cause I thought she was
pretty smart, and tough, too!

388
00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:40.420
When it comes time for us to fight,
we won't back down from any challenge.

389
00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.670
But we can't do anything
now, so shut up!

390
00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.610
If all we can do
is yell, let us yell!

391
00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:51.030
Go back to Onigashima!

392
00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:52.960
You're evil!

393
00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.300
You Green Kaido!

394
00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.490
You Big Green Mom!

395
00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:56.980
Mosshead sucks!

396
00:17:57.060 --> 00:18:00.430
Boo! Boo! Boo! Boo!

397
00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:03.140
Shut up, fourth place.

398
00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.520
Uh! Don't you dare!

399
00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:09.920
I have to take charge,
since I outrank you!

400
00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:12.050
Ah!

401
00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.020
So, you think you're
better than me huh?

402
00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:14.640
Yeah!

403
00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.430
I always have been,
and I always will be!

404
00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:18.310
Ah!

405
00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:23.650
There's so much
to catch up on.

406
00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:27.260
Apparently, the whole world turned
upside down while we were in Wano.

407
00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:30.870
A lot has changed, and more
change appears to be on the way.

408
00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:34.500
The Seven Warlords
might become an issue.

409
00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:38.290
They're running wild after
the Government shut the system down.

410
00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:43.610
For example, three of them came
together to form Cross Guild.

411
00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:49.310
As a result, Buggy was apparently crowned
one of the new Four Emperors of the Sea.

412
00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:52.150
There's no way
that story is true!

413
00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.330
We can't confirm
it ourselves yet.

414
00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:57.230
For the time being,
it's the only truth we have.

415
00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:00.200
Thank you, Brook.

416
00:19:00.850 --> 00:19:05.790
By the way, I noticed a few more
names you might recognize.

417
00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.040
