Anyway, Sabo's innocent.

425
00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:38.220
When he was little, his parents
were always strict with him.

426
00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.910
He just wants
everyone to be free!

427
00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:48.110
The three of us,
we're gonna leave this country.

428
00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:51.470
We're gonna sail the seas
and see the world.

429
00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:55.710
And once I've done it all, I'm gonna write
a book for kids like me.

430
