of 'em.

432
00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.710
We're gonna be pirates!

433
00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.170
Hehehehe.

434
00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.290
You don't gotta tell me!

435
00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:11.790
