441
00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:27.990
But they won't ignore me.

442
00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:31.630
That's what it means to be strong,
to be a great pirate!

443
00:20:32.050 --> 00:20:34.510
I won't ever lose, and I won't ever run
away!

444
00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:38.030
Who cares if the world fears me or
respects me or whatever?

445
00:20:38.390 --> 00:20:39.850
I'm gonna be a legend!

446
00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:46.200
We made an oath.

447
00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:49.050
Sabo, me, and Ace, together.

448
00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:50.360
Hehehehe.

449
00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:53.700
Then I know what
I'm gonna do, too!

450
00:20:57.740 --> 00:20:59.020
Someday I...

451
00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.420
Someday I...

452
00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:03.780
Huh?

453
00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:05.100
Huh?

454
00:21:08.960 --> 00:21:09.940
