Huh?

459
00:21:17.070 --> 00:21:17.560
You certainly know
how to entertain, don't you?

460
00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:18.040
Hold on.

461
00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:18.520
No, no.

462
00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:19.220
No way.

463
00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:20.710
That's too crazy!

464
00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.350
I love it!

465
00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:24.420
I think that's
perfect, Captain!

466
00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.080
Hey, Chopper!

467
00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.740
Might wanna
examine his head!

468
00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.040
Oh, come on!

469
00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:34.620
That is impossible
and you know it!

470
00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:35.450
Huh?

471
00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:38.370
Maybe it'll be possible once
I'm King of the Pirates!

472
00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.300
No one but you would think
